  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Angel Network Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support La Tani&#xe8;re Business Angel Network (TBAN), a recently established Business Angels Network in Senegal, by providing capacity building to build a robust Business Angel Network infrastructure. Angel investors play a crucial role in empowering aspiring entrepreneurs, offering financial support, expertise and networks. Nairobi Business Angel Network (NaiBAN) will equip TBAN with the necessary knowledge, skills and tools based on their own learning experience. This initiative enables TBAN to thrive in their role as catalyst for growth for young local start-ups.</narrative>
  </description>
